{"id":"n5f480d4b31","headline":"House prices rise, but not the risk for banks - DBRS's signal","summary":"House prices in Greece are rising, but DBRS signals that this does not increase the risk for banks. The report is presented as a DBRS signal on housing and bank credit risk.","why":"DBRS Morningstar is a credit rating agency, and its views on bank risk affect funding costs for lenders. Housing prices influence bank loan collateral values and mortgage credit quality.","category":"economy","event_type":"other","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Athens","country":"Greece","lat":37.98,"lon":23.73,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"sofokleous10.gr","url":"https://sofokleous10.gr/2026/10/05/%CE%B1%CE%BA%CF%81%CE%B9%CE%B2%CE%B1%CE%AF%CE%BD%CE%BF%CF%85%CE%BD-%CF%84%CE%B1-%CF%83%CF%80%CE%AF%CF%84%CE%B9%CE%B1-%CF%8C%CF%87%CE%B9-%CF%8C%CE%BC%CF%89%CF%82-%CE%BA%CE%B1%CE%B9-%CF%84%CE%BF-%CF%81/"},"sources":[{"name":"sofokleous10.gr","url":"https://sofokleous10.gr/2026/10/05/%CE%B1%CE%BA%CF%81%CE%B9%CE%B2%CE%B1%CE%AF%CE%BD%CE%BF%CF%85%CE%BD-%CF%84%CE%B1-%CF%83%CF%80%CE%AF%CF%84%CE%B9%CE%B1-%CF%8C%CF%87%CE%B9-%CF%8C%CE%BC%CF%89%CF%82-%CE%BA%CE%B1%CE%B9-%CF%84%CE%BF-%CF%81/"}],"published_at":"2026-10-05T08:47:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-14T17:26:37Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"2b707040dbc10ea4","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-14T17:26:37Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-05T08:47:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-05T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"GR","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"Ακριβαίνουν τα σπίτια, όχι όμως και το ρίσκο για τις τράπεζες - Το σήμα της DBRS","source_language":"ell","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/ho